# An ADVENTURE event's story nodes -- Happy Holloween! (the Halloween event, 2026 script).
# The format is dcbossrush_npc.txt's (npc / spot, art, image, line, say, music, bgm, exit, desc).
# A speaker@look (pl010@holloween) is drawn in that costume sprite (dcbossrush 0.18.1).

npc 26 soul Too Quiet
bg seireitei_library
desc The Tenth Division office. It has been far too quiet today.
bgm bgm_adv_0040
say - |  | Just as Toshiro Hitsugaya finishes his last task for the day, he notices something.
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | It has been awfully quiet today. Too quiet... ...Oh, damn it.
say - |  | Hitsugaya gets up and rushes to his Lieutenant's office. But nobody is there.
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | There is a giant stack of papers she was supposed to do. Where is she?!
say pl012 | Rangiku Matsumoto | Captain! Good morning!
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | It's afternoon!
say pl012 | Rangiku Matsumoto | You're right, it's afternoon. The sun is going down, the night approaches and going outside becomes... spooky.
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | I don't know about spooky, but the only thing that actually scares me is knowing what you do when I'm not checking on you. There are so many papers on your desk.
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | I'm glad you're at least checking your mailbox.
say pl012 | Rangiku Matsumoto | ...
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | Matsumoto.
say pl012 | Rangiku Matsumoto | Did we recently get one?
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | It's been here for months!
say pl012 | Rangiku Matsumoto | Ah, it's whatever. Nothing in there is actually important, unlike the news I brought from the human realm!
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | You don't even know what's in the mailbox!
say pl012 | Rangiku Matsumoto | Captain Hitsugaya, have you ever heard of Halloween?
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | It's fine, it's fine, this is not your first time with her...
say pl012 | Rangiku Matsumoto | Come again?
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | Forget it. No, I haven't heard of it.
say pl012 | Rangiku Matsumoto | It's a special day the World of the Living has once a year. People dress up like scary monsters and go around gathering candy!
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | This sounds like it's made for children.
say pl012 | Rangiku Matsumoto | It's totally not! Orihime told me all about it and showed me pictures of adult women in nurse costumes.
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | I thought they were supposed to be scary.
say pl012 | Rangiku Matsumoto | I didn't say they were good costumes. Anyway, since the humans have their Halloween festival, why don't we have our own?!
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | The papers on your-
say pl012 | Rangiku Matsumoto | We'll call it Holloween! It will be so much fun, I already know what I'll dress up as. Tomorrow is the big day!
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | Matsumoto, can you hold on for a second?! Just because you want something doesn't mean you can- Matsumoto?
say - |  | The woman was long gone, and so was Toshiro's hope that the work on his Lieutenant's desk would be done anytime soon.
exit The question that remained now was... what was about to happen tomorrow?

npc 62 soul Happy Holloween
bg seireitei_library
desc The next evening. Rangiku is nowhere to be found, and the Seireitei looks... different.
art momo_hinamori
bgm bgm_adv_0150
say - |  | The next day, Rangiku is nowhere to be found, and Hitsugaya takes it upon himself to finish his Lieutenant's work. He knows it would all fall back on him eventually.
say - |  | It is almost evening when he finishes.
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | I'll have to monitor her more. This woman just disappears into thin air. She's probably drinking somewhere with her friends.
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | Tomorrow I'll wake her up personally and drag her in here, no matter how hungover she is.
scene seireitei_walkway
say - |  | When the Captain opens the door to the Seireitei, he walks face-first into fake cobwebs and almost steps in a pumpkin.
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | What the-
say momo_hinamori@holloween | Momo Hinamori | Happy Holloween, Shiro!
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | Momo?! What are you wearing? And did you just say "Holloween"?
say momo_hinamori@holloween | Momo Hinamori | This is my costume for today, I'm a cat maid! Haven't you heard the news?
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | Don't tell me that-
say momo_hinamori@holloween | Momo Hinamori | Rangiku told us we're having a Holloween party and should all dress up as something spooky.
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | And you chose to be a cat maid...?
say momo_hinamori@holloween | Momo Hinamori | I provide bad service. And now imagine if you had an allergy, too.
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | I've got to find Matsumoto...
say momo_hinamori@holloween | Momo Hinamori | Even Captain Aizen dressed up as a mummy. I can show you his costume, if you help me get into Muken.
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | Give it up, Momo.
say momo_hinamori@holloween | Momo Hinamori | Never!
exit A shriek echoes down the lane. Something that is not a costume drops from the rooftops.

npc 97 soul An Unfortunate Choice of Words
bg seireitei_alleyway
desc Hollows inside the walls of the Seireitei, and a Lieutenant who takes things literally.
art nemu_kurotsuchi
bgm bgm_adv_0170
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | I can't believe this. Why are Hollows appearing in the Seireitei?
say nemu_kurotsuchi | Nemu Kurotsuchi | Captain Hitsugaya.
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | Lieutenant Kurotsuchi. I'm glad you still look normal and didn't dress up like an idiot.
say nemu_kurotsuchi | Nemu Kurotsuchi | ...
say nemu_kurotsuchi | Nemu Kurotsuchi | Can you repeat that?
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | I said it seems people are dressing up as stupid things today.
say nemu_kurotsuchi | Nemu Kurotsuchi | Have you just called Master Mayuri an idiot to my face?
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | What?! No, he is always dressed up, I didn't even think of him!
say nemu_kurotsuchi | Nemu Kurotsuchi | I can't let something like this go.
exit Nemu steps forward. She is not listening anymore.

npc 97 soul Missing Bait
bg seireitei_alleyway
desc Nemu has stopped attacking. Something has gone missing from the Twelfth Division.
art nemu_kurotsuchi
bgm bgm_adv_0180
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | Stop attacking me! I was talking about Hinamori, and probably Matsumoto!
say nemu_kurotsuchi | Nemu Kurotsuchi | Oh. Why didn't you say so earlier?
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | Because you didn't let me!
say nemu_kurotsuchi | Nemu Kurotsuchi | I see. I apologize for my actions.
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | It's fine. Maybe you can help me. Have you seen Matsumoto anywhere? Apparently she's holding some kind of costume party she calls Holloween.
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | It's inspired by something similar in the World of the Living.
say nemu_kurotsuchi | Nemu Kurotsuchi | I'm sorry, I have not seen her today. I've been looking for some Hollow bait that disappeared from our laboratory.
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | Hollow bait? That could explain why I found Hollows inside the walls.
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | You don't think Matsumoto and the missing bait are related, do you?
say nemu_kurotsuchi | Nemu Kurotsuchi | I have not thought about this yet.
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | Either way, I have to find her. Let me know once you've located the missing bait!
say nemu_kurotsuchi | Nemu Kurotsuchi | I will.
exit Nemu bows and leaves. Further down the lane, two Hollows howl at the lanterns.

npc 10 soul Trick or Treat
bg seireitei_water_pathway
desc A succubus and a... whatever Renji is supposed to be.
bgm bgm_adv_0360
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | Where could she be...?
say pl010@holloween | Rukia Kuchiki | Trick or treat, Captain Hitsugaya!
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | Kuchiki?! What- what are you wearing?!
say pl010@holloween | Rukia Kuchiki | Isn't it cute? I'm a succubus. This is my Holloween costume.
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | I-
say pl008@holloween | Renji Abarai | Oh, there you are. I was trying to catch up to you, but it's kinda hard to walk in this.
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | Not you, too.
say pl010@holloween | Rukia Kuchiki | Captain Hitsugaya, why aren't you dressed up?
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | First of all, I didn't have time to even think about a costume, because I was busy doing the tasks that were assigned to Matsumoto.
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | Second of all, where is Matsumoto in the first place?!
say pl008@holloween | Renji Abarai | She's at the Holloween party. At-
say pl010@holloween | Rukia Kuchiki | Silence, Renji! It sounds like telling him the location could ruin the party.
say pl008@holloween | Renji Abarai | You're right.
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | This is unbelievable...
exit Rukia draws Sode no Shirayuki, wings and all. The party's location will have to be earned.

npc 10 soul The Third Division
bg seireitei_water_pathway
desc Rukia gives up the party's location.
bgm bgm_adv_0080
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | Are you going to tell me where that party is now?
say pl010@holloween | Rukia Kuchiki | I guess I have no choice. The party is being held in the Third Division barracks.
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | The Third Division, huh?
say pl010@holloween | Rukia Kuchiki | Rangiku said something about there being no Captain and that Kira would never say no to her.
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | This woman needs to be stopped. I can't believe this.
exit On the way to the Third Division, three Hollows block the road between the lanterns.

npc 7 soul The Party
bg seireitei_barracks
desc The Third Division barracks: loud music, pumpkins, garlands, and a familiar guest at the door.
bgm bgm_adv_0330
say - |  | Captain Hitsugaya arrives in front of the Third Division barracks and already hears loud music. There is decoration everywhere he looks: pumpkins, fake cobwebs and tons of garlands.
say - |  | Soul Reapers in every costume imaginable are enjoying the party.
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | Matsumoto! Come out immediately, I know you're here!
say pl007@holloween | Yoruichi Shihoin | Why are you so angry, Captain Hitsugaya? Didn't you get any treats yet?
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | Even you are here?
say pl007@holloween | Yoruichi Shihoin | Well, I kind of told Rangiku about Halloween in the first place. Of course I was joining in for some fun.
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | Does the Head Captain know about this?
say pl007@holloween | Yoruichi Shihoin | Why would he?
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | Enough. I'm sorry, but I'm going straight in there to drag Matsumoto back to her office.
say pl007@holloween | Yoruichi Shihoin | I'm afraid I can't let you do that. Don't you see how much fun everyone is having?
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | I'm certainly having none.
exit Yoruichi stretches, grinning. The Goddess of Flash isn't moving from that door.

npc 12 soul Matsumoto!
bg barracks_wall
desc Inside the barracks, the hostess of the evening.
bgm bgm_adv_0330
say - |  | After the encounter with Yoruichi, the Captain bursts into the barracks.
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | Matsumoto!
say pl012@holloween | Rangiku Matsumoto | Captain! I'm so glad you came, hello! And happy Holloween!
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | I'm not nearly as glad to see you. Do you have any idea what you've caused?
say pl012@holloween | Rangiku Matsumoto | A lot of fun?
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | You're coming back with me, right now.
say pl012@holloween | Rangiku Matsumoto | There is no way I'm leaving already. Do you know how long it took to get dressed up in the first place?
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | That's none of my concern!
exit Rangiku sets down her drink. If he wants her to leave, he'll have to make her.

npc 29 soul The Real Culprit
bg barracks_wall
desc The party is over. Or so Toshiro thinks.
bgm bgm_adv_0330
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | Come on, now.
say pl012@holloween | Rangiku Matsumoto | Just because I wanted to have a fun party...
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | You know, I'm used to you not working properly. It's one thing for you to abandon your tasks. Same for randomly decorating our barracks. But I draw the line when you endanger other people.
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | And that is exactly what you've done.
say pl012@holloween | Rangiku Matsumoto | Endanger? Are you talking about alcohol poisoning?
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | I'm talking about the Hollow bait you stole from Captain Kurotsuchi's laboratory for your themed party. Do you have any idea how many Hollows are in the Seireitei right now?
say pl012@holloween | Rangiku Matsumoto | Stolen Hollow bait? Wait a second, I have nothing to do with that. I called it Holloween as a wordplay on Halloween. You really think I would lure Hollows in here?
say pl012@holloween | Rangiku Matsumoto | How could we have fun knowing there are Hollows everywhere?
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | But who else would do something like this?!
music bgm_adv_0230
say pl029@post_aizen | Mayuri Kurotsuchi | It seems my experiment has failed.
say pl012@holloween | Rangiku Matsumoto | Captain Kurotsuchi?
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | What are you doing here? What experiment are you talking about?
say pl029@post_aizen | Mayuri Kurotsuchi | I heard earlier that some Soul Reapers were planning to hold a party called Holloween.
say pl029@post_aizen | Mayuri Kurotsuchi | And that name got me wondering: how ready would a bunch of drunken Soul Reapers be when an attack arises?
say pl029@post_aizen | Mayuri Kurotsuchi | Sadly, Captain Hitsugaya took care of most of them, so I will have to redo this experiment another day, when nobody expects it.
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | But even Nemu said the bait was stolen.
say pl029@post_aizen | Mayuri Kurotsuchi | Did she say that? That just speaks to her not checking our stock properly. I don't tell her everything I do, for this very reason.
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | I still can't believe you would risk so many lives for an experiment like this.
say pl029@post_aizen | Mayuri Kurotsuchi | You really can't believe that?
say pl012@holloween | Rangiku Matsumoto | And even worse, you made me look guilty in front of my Captain!
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | Is that really worse...?
say pl012@holloween | Rangiku Matsumoto | To me it is, and I won't let that slide!
exit Rangiku draws Haineko and stands at her Captain's side. Mayuri sighs, as if this were all very tedious.

npc 12 soul Holloween Is Here to Stay
bg barracks_wall
desc After Mayuri leaves, the party goes on.
bgm bgm_adv_0340
say - |  | After Mayuri leaves, the Holloween party continues, and even Captain Hitsugaya stays a little longer.
say pl012@holloween | Rangiku Matsumoto | Isn't this fun?
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | Well, it could be, if you'd planned it properly and hadn't left me all your work.
say pl012@holloween | Rangiku Matsumoto | Huh? I never told you to do it. I was about to do it all tomorrow.
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | We both know that wasn't happening.
say pl012@holloween | Rangiku Matsumoto | Or maybe the day after tomorrow...
say - |  | Toshiro sighs.
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | Let's not think about that now.
say pl012@holloween | Rangiku Matsumoto | Yeah. Let's think about your costume for next year instead. This time I made an exception, but next time nobody gets in without dressing up.
say pl026 | Toshiro Hitsugaya | So we're doing this every year now?
say pl012@holloween | Rangiku Matsumoto | Of course we are! Holloween is here to stay!
say - |  | It was a long night for Captain Hitsugaya, but almost a usual one for Rangiku.
say - |  | While one of them couldn't wait to get back to his normal life, the other was already planning an even bigger party for next year.
exit Happy Holloween!
